                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">020</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>年</FONT>6月22日下午，绍兴一中养新书藏图书馆报告厅里掌声雷动、笑声连连——一场别样“明星见面会”盛大举行。不过学生们追的不是娱乐明星，而是科学文化界的明星。这次的明星主角是香港中文大学（深圳）副校长、加拿大工程院院士、加拿大皇家科学院院士朱世平教授。朱世平教授是应我校邀请参加“博雅大讲堂”，为高一学生带来了一场《科学的三生三世及C位学业规划》的专业讲座。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062313563231.jpg" target=_blank><FONT size=4><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062313563231.jpg" width=3648 height=2736> </FONT></A></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT size=4 face=宋体><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14px; FONT-FAMILY: "Microsoft YaHei", "Segoe UI", system-ui, Roboto, "Droid Sans", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif, Tahoma, "Segoe UI SymbolMyanmar Text", 微软雅黑; WHITE-SPACE: pre-wrap; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(17,31,44); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial'>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(17,31,44); FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=宋体>讲座正式开始前，朱世平副校长代表香港中文大学（深圳）向绍兴一中颁发了</FONT>"优质生源基地"荣誉牌。校党委书记、校长王琛亲自接牌。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(17,31,44); FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062313584245.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062313584245.jpg" width=3648 height=2736> </A></o:p></SPAN></P></SPAN></FONT></SPAN>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062313591730.png" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062313591730.png" width=302 height=337> </A></FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>朱世平教授长期致力于高分子材料工程科学的研究，专长聚合反应工程、聚合物结构调控、生物材料表面改性、智能高分子材料开发、及用于水和空气净化的高效絮凝剂、吸附剂、萃取剂等。在国际学术刊物上发表论文</FONT>350多篇，被引用上万次，已培养硕士、博士、博士后人才120多名。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>讲座中，朱世平教授从科学与工程的视角，讲解了工程学科门类及发展历程；从人造玫瑰花、尿不湿、防弹衣等例子，介绍了高分子材料的理论基础及生产工艺，拓展了学生对于化学材料相关专业的理解。同时，对于高中生如何做好学业及生涯规划，朱世平教授也给出了</FONT>“C位规划”的建议。他提出，高中生要做好学业规划，就要学会学习，养成良好的学习习惯，选择视野广阔的大类专业，保持开放思维，及时应对新机会，最重要的是享受努力拼搏的过程。朱世平教授的讲座深入浅出，有趣有料，赢得学生的阵阵掌声。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314001726.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314001726.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062313595397.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062313595397.jpg" width=3648 height=2736> </A></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314003561.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314003561.jpg" width=3648 height=2736> </A></FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>据悉，</FONT>“博雅大讲堂”是我校为全面提高学生综合素质、扩大学生学术视野、丰富学生课余生活而开办的大型系列学术活动。“博雅”二字既体现了讲座的文化内涵，也寄寓了学校对学子们的美好祝愿，同时与我校博雅校风相呼应，彰显学校特色。“博雅大讲堂”系列学术活动是我校正在着力构建以学生为主体的360°环绕式生涯课堂体系的主要组成部分。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">360°环绕式生涯课堂体系包括由生涯教师指导的</SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>生涯探索课堂</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>、任课老师指导的</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学科生涯发展课堂</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>、班主任指导的</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>求真课堂</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>、家长指导的</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>爸妈课堂</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>、专家指导的</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>博雅大讲堂</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>、学长学姐指导的</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学长课堂</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（饮水思源系列活动）以及</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>社会大课堂</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（职业体验等系列活动）。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 5pt 0pt 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT size=4 face=宋体>该课堂体系希望通过塑造导向全面发展的育人氛围、提供生涯发展工具资源、创造学生发展平台，帮助学生树立正确理想信念、正确认识自我，更好适应高中学习生活，处理好个人兴趣特长与国家和社会需要的关系，提高选修课程、选考科目、报考专业和未来发展方向的自主选择能力，促进全人格发展。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
